{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And he offered offering.</b> Like the way of those who go down to the sea in ships, as it is written, ויזבחו זבחי תודה. This too, because he stood in great distress and the world was destroyed while he escaped." "<b>[And he offered offering — he brought up burnt-offerings.]</b> <b>On the altar.</b> It is the designated one upon which Adam, Cain, and Abel offered."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:30.728383371Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}